sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M2M as Daemon / Microservice
    participant KC as Keycloak (Auth Server)
    participant API as Protected Resource API
    
    M2M->>KC: POST /token (grant_type=client_credentials & client_id & client_secret)
    KC->>M2M: Returns Access Token (Service Account)
    M2M->>API: HTTP Request with Bearer Access Token
    API->>API: Validates token signature & scopes
    API->>M2M: Returns requested data
